# SCPN Dense Plasma Focus Core — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version,
  or DOI exists yet; cite the repository state you inspected.
type: software
title: SCPN Dense Plasma Focus Core
abstract: >-
  Governed device-family repository for the dense-plasma-focus
  configuration within the SCPN Reactor Systems Research Group. Evidence
  maturity computational_prototype: a validated device configuration model,
  diagnostic and clock semantics aligned with the SCPN Phase Orchestrator
  observability catalogue, level-0 device physics (closed forms of the Lee
  model: bank normalisation, axial and radial characteristic quantities,
  pinch-phase terms, fast-ion-beam chain and neutron estimates, anchored to
  its table of twelve fitted machines), and tessellated and B-rep device
  models with STL, glTF and STEP exports. All parameter sets are synthetic;
  no real machine is described, and the claim inventory is empty.
